{
  "info": {
    "name": "ApiTarjetas",
    "description": "API de Tarjetas (ASP.NET Core 8 + SQL Server) — Clase 02, Lab 02.\n\nLectura vía EF Core; escritura vía Stored Procedures TARJETA_Add / _Update / _Delete.\n\nEjecuta las peticiones en orden: el POST guarda el id creado en la variable `tarjetaId`.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "tarjetaId", "value": "1" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Registrar tarjeta",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('201 Created', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
              "const id = pm.response.json().id;",
              "pm.test('Devuelve id', () => pm.expect(id).to.be.a('number'));",
              "pm.collectionVariables.set('tarjetaId', id);"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "listen": "prerequest",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "// Genera un número de 16 dígitos distinto en cada ejecución (NUMERO_TARJETA_VC es UNIQUE)",
              "const sufijo = String(Date.now()).slice(-12);",
              "pm.variables.set('numeroTarjeta', '4111' + sufijo);"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
        "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/tarjetas", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "tarjetas"] },
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"numeroTarjeta\": \"{{numeroTarjeta}}\",\n  \"nombreTitular\": \"JUAN PEREZ\",\n  \"tipoTarjeta\": \"CREDITO\",\n  \"limiteCredito\": 5000,\n  \"fechaVencimiento\": \"2029-12-31\",\n  \"usuarioCreacion\": \"lab\"\n}",
          "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
        },
        "description": "Alta de tarjeta. Ejecuta `api.TARJETA_Add`.\n\nValidaciones:\n- `numeroTarjeta`: exactamente 16 dígitos.\n- `limiteCredito`: no negativo.\n\nRespuesta: `201 Created` con `{ \"id\": n }` y cabecera `Location`."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Obtener tarjeta por id",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "pm.test('Id coincide', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().tarjetaId).to.eql(Number(pm.collectionVariables.get('tarjetaId'))));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/tarjetas/{{tarjetaId}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "tarjetas", "{{tarjetaId}}"] },
        "description": "Consulta una tarjeta por id (EF Core, sin tracking). `404` si no existe."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Listar tarjetas activas",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "pm.test('Es un arreglo', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json()).to.be.an('array'));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/tarjetas", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "tarjetas"] },
        "description": "Lista las tarjetas con `ESTADO_BT = 1`."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "4. Actualizar tarjeta",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": ["pm.test('204 No Content', () => pm.response.to.have.status(204));"]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "PUT",
        "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
        "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/tarjetas/{{tarjetaId}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "tarjetas", "{{tarjetaId}}"] },
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"nombreTitular\": \"JUAN PEREZ LOPEZ\",\n  \"limiteCredito\": 7500\n}",
          "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
        },
        "description": "Modifica titular y límite. Ejecuta `api.TARJETA_Update`. Solo se usan `nombreTitular` y `limiteCredito`; el id va en la URL."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "5. Eliminar tarjeta (baja lógica)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": ["pm.test('204 No Content', () => pm.response.to.have.status(204));"]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "DELETE",
        "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/tarjetas/{{tarjetaId}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "tarjetas", "{{tarjetaId}}"] },
        "description": "Baja lógica: `ESTADO_BT = 0`. Ejecuta `api.TARJETA_Delete`. La tarjeta deja de aparecer en el listado pero sigue siendo consultable por id."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Errores",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Registrar con número inválido",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/tarjetas", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "tarjetas"] },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"numeroTarjeta\": \"123\",\n  \"nombreTitular\": \"JUAN PEREZ\",\n  \"tipoTarjeta\": \"CREDITO\",\n  \"limiteCredito\": 5000,\n  \"fechaVencimiento\": \"2029-12-31\",\n  \"usuarioCreacion\": \"lab\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "description": "El servicio lanza `ArgumentException`. Hoy la API no la traduce a 400, así que responde **500**."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Obtener tarjeta inexistente",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": ["pm.test('404 Not Found', () => pm.response.to.have.status(404));"]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/tarjetas/999999", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "tarjetas", "999999"] }
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
